cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or dataset, please cite both the software and the paper below."
title: "Spatially-Gated Deep GNN: income-conditioned climate gating for internal migration flows in Mexico"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible pipeline that assembles a dyadic municipality-to-municipality
  internal migration dataset for Mexico (2,457 harmonized municipalities,
  6,034,392 ordered pairs) with gravity-model covariates, and a graph neural
  network whose climate features are gated by an income-conditioned FiLM layer.
type: software
license: MIT

